Usage: qodercli plugins|plugin [options] [command]

Manage plugins

Options:
  -h, --help                           display help for command

Commands:
  list [options]                       List installed plugins.
  validate [options] <path>            Validates a plugin from a local directory
                                       or manifest.
  install|i [options] <plugin>         Install a plugin from available
                                       marketplaces, a remote HTTPS .zip URL, or
                                       a local directory path.
  uninstall|remove [options] <plugin>  Uninstall a plugin.
  enable [options] <plugin>            Enable a disabled plugin.
  disable [options] [plugin]           Disable an enabled plugin.
  update [options] <plugin>            Update a plugin to the latest version
                                       from its marketplace.
  marketplace|mp                       Manage plugin marketplaces.
